{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（6日）下午5時28分，警方接獲多個報案，指旺角山東街一幢住宅大廈天台起火，現場有約30至40名住戶，自行疏散至地面。初步未有接獲受傷報告。據了解，懷疑天台有雜物首先起火。</p><p>網上圖片可見，火場冒出大量濃煙，猛烈火光席捲半空，旺角甚至大角咀等多區均可目視。消防接報後迅速趕抵現場，並出動一條喉及派出一隊煙帽隊進行灌救，救援行動仍在進行中。現場所見，消防登上毗鄰大廈天廈，再往火場射水。</p><figure><img alt=\"山東街有大廈天台著火。（戴慧豐攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184203892800360448132940.jpeg/j9JZpI5NzhI0nD5yvCOI2m06RpqOmsKlmX8-RKN_PkQ\"/><figcaption>山東街有大廈天台著火。（戴慧豐攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防登上毗鄰大廈，再從天台射水往火場。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184204407332409344048923.jpeg/8V1MXRcvM0dDqlBF6ISKntjYsCov82HzvP8OFZn_DhU\"/><figcaption>消防登上毗鄰大廈，再從天台射水往火場。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"旺角大廈有天台起大火。（戴慧豐攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184204410474074112604357.jpeg/gLGSdMmylOYVQ3XZeKz1XAq0v4KK9YHVJx6uEAIerhA\"/><figcaption>旺角大廈有天台起大火。（戴慧豐攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據報，天台有雜物燃燒。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184204413326331904178349.jpeg/5b9D4aQemlQb3ky1G2UVdWAJE1e7sUw20Jt8ifWbfIk\"/><figcaption>據報，天台有雜物燃燒。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場火勢猛烈，旺角甚至大角咀等多區均可目睹。（Threads terrytsf_acgver·）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184202391675736064947068.png/_Yakn_sSyTfyYsSFADQTPixb6xMOlSa08XDCafFwwmk\"/><figcaption>現場火勢猛烈，旺角甚至大角咀等多區均可目睹。（Threads terrytsf_acgver·）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場火勢猛烈，旺角甚至大角咀等多區均可目睹。（Threads catkowu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184202394251169792357219.png/68RiqNWcAIZRl3oOHyJ6G2u-YNhbsnSZ4zt_J-M7fyc\"/><figcaption>現場火勢猛烈，旺角甚至大角咀等多區均可目睹。（Threads catkowu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火場冒出猛烈火光及大量濃煙，席捲半空。（網上相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184200354213138432874936.jpeg/PkL_jz1DI7L0tfp8FCzimMy146jm6GB_UOX0jlDl9I4\"/><figcaption>火場冒出猛烈火光及大量濃煙，席捲半空。（網上相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火場冒出猛烈火光及大量濃煙，席捲半空。（網上相片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184200351939694592413528.jpeg/gWe70C3TjNS5nUKFhT3MgVAtAmsmShiT9nqH8fZ6h_E\"/><figcaption>火場冒出猛烈火光及大量濃煙，席捲半空。（網上相片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火場冒出猛烈火光及大量濃煙，席捲半空。（threads  _cccyril0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184200349364260864710253.png/BF44OVKdwol96QwUnklgMFwIx9Tw6eO_kjz6G5I8-hs\"/><figcaption>火場冒出猛烈火光及大量濃煙，席捲半空。（threads  _cccyril0）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T10:20:52.365654+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":454,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}